 stage at diagnosis, United States, 2014 to 2020. All patients were followed through 2021. White and Black race are exclusive of Hispanic ethnicity. aExcludes appendix.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d1d7ee73fb4a528a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1591b0ad546781f6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCancer Stat Facts: Common Cancer Sites - SEER\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1591b0ad546781f6\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/common.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"17fbaf1c77c0c79b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>Lung and bronchus cancer</strong> is responsible for the most deaths with 124,730 people expected to die from this disease. That is nearly three times the 52,900 deaths due to colorectal cancer, which is the second most common cause of cancer death.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"17fbaf1c77c0c79b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"seer.cancer.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5b7e3ef1ebae9af3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCancer statistics, 2025 - Siegel - 2025 - CA: A Cancer Journal for Clinicians - Wiley Online Library\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5b7e3ef1ebae9af3\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://acsjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.3322/caac.21871\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"109ff7cc91d1ff91\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe methods for abstraction and age-adjustment of mortality data before 1969 are described elsewhere.13, 14 Contemporary 5-year mortality rates for Puerto Rico were obtained from State Cancer Profiles (statecancerprofiles.cancer.gov, August 1, 2024), a collaboration between the CDC and the NCI.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"109ff7cc91d1ff91\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 16, 