{"type": "message", "id": "b61076aa", "parentId": "7f97c19b", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T03:53:13.044Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_9b387a1327904beb90415ef5", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"mesothelioma annual cases United States 2024 2025\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 944,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d89860453c3097ab\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIncidence of Malignant Mesothelioma | U.S. Cancer Statistics | CDC\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d89860453c3097ab\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cdc.gov/united-states-cancer-statistics/publications/mesothelioma.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d40e9a1d651da545\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe rate of new mesothelioma cases is going down because fewer people are exposed to asbestos. Mesothelioma is a cancer that forms in the mesothelium, the thin tissue that lines many internal organs. Mesothelioma is a rare cancer—<strong>2,669 cases were reported in the United States in 2022</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d40e9a1d651da545\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"September 11, 2025\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cdc.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d1dd6e33757d795e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Incidence | Cases Per Year & Trends by ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d1dd6e33757d795e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.asbestos.com/mesothelioma/incidence/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"20302a9e41a29208\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nDoctors diagnose <strong>about 3,000 cases annually</strong>. Incidence trends reflect a 20 to 60 year latency period. U.S. mesothelioma incidence declined roughly 55% for men since a 1992 peak, while women’s rates were relatively stable, per SEER data.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"20302a9e41a29208\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"October 15, 2021\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.asbestos.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1d01cc6cd7be002d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2024 Mesothelioma Statistics\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1d01cc6cd7be002d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://williamstriallawyers.com/mesothelioma-statistics/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8c2b39fcfeffca30\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nLegally Reviewed by Joseph P. Williams on March 14, 2025 · Mesothelioma is an uncommon cancer, occurring at a rate of <strong>1 in 100,000 individuals</strong>. According to the latest available data, there were 2,681 new cases of mesothelioma reported in the ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8c2b39fcfeffca30\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 25, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"williamstriallawyers.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d866f2452091445c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Incidence & Survival Statistics (2015–2025) | Mesothelioma-Lung-Cancer.org\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d866f2452091445c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://mesothelioma-lung-cancer.org/data/mesothelioma-statistics/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5f4098991b8e2da6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>Approximately 3,000</strong> new mesothelioma cases are diagnosed annually in the United States, a rate that has remained relatively stable since 2015.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5f4098991b8e2da6\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"1 month ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"mesothelioma-lung-cancer.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5a7525ad550cd64a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Statistics 2026 | Cases & Death Rates\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5a7525ad550cd64a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sokolovelaw.com/mesothelioma/statistics/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2f638f46bcc4d90d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>Over 62,000 talcum powder lawsuits have been filed by people suffering from mesothelioma, ovarian cancer, and other asbestos-related diseases. Up to 30% of mesothelioma cases in the United States stem from non-occupational or secondhand asbestos exposure</strong>...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2f638f46bcc4d90d\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"March 1, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.sokolovelaw.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "mesothelioma annual cases United States 2024 2025", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 944, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d89860453c3097ab\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIncidence of Malignant Mesothelioma | U.S. Cancer Statistics | CDC\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d89860453c3097ab\">>>", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/united-states-cancer-statistics/publications/mesothelioma.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d40e9a1d651da545\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe rate of new mesothelioma cases is going down because fewer people are exposed to asbestos. Mesothelioma is a cancer that forms in the mesothelium, the thin tissue that lines many internal organs. Mesothelioma is a rare cancer—<strong>2,669 cases were reported in the United States in 2022</strong>.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d40e9a1d651da545\">>>", "published": "September 11, 2025", "siteName": "www.cdc.gov"}, {"title": "\n<<<