END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7a692bfd4bc6e129\">>>", "url": "https://www.hepb.org/research-and-programs/liver/staging-of-liver-cancer/survival-rates/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ad73909a71111443\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe 5-year survival rate from liver cancer varies from about <strong>10% to 14%</strong>. This survival rate is low partly because many people with liver cancer also have cirrhosis, which itself is a serious liver disease.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ad73909a71111443\">>>", "siteName": "www.hepb.org"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775274800680}}
